43387_7765966346838941804_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6yQFYvtoh18Q7kNvwEHOkLG&_nc_oc=AdrBjRzRAFvJCMM4BwLQDSr-Mezj3Jax49YgLleJuM4I75Y2u_8_6p1kFSsk5VxBqG8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTbHrX15T0cOKoQpH1F2mDkIRopFQKaq1ytP4CeH48DAw&oe=6AFC68B9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "750408350958726", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830888_750408354292059_3119623694371327415_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=suim9_yfrEMQ7kNvwHho_am&_nc_oc=AdrEHI0uCU3S0dGWIzgB9GPChoTQLcfeFx-5NIq_aoeto-hXua1KFAf-c-w-9My2mAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5_W33b4lJpvr6WeRoM3FXF6b2vhb79SIIGmGBlhgwtw&oe=6AFC8F6D"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1315182506894850", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824611_1315182510228183_9198081156175562440_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M_QgusNo5BcQ7kNvwHW7x2U&_nc_oc=AdrhMQLz2cQntyWyjhILVMzKFRVL_WIqJs6ICfUyXkhRqoa6ShzJndt85Sy02X3QOr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxaaauFXQq7C5fAWhGlJaaC81aswrDv2zZ9UvPiZu0HQ&oe=6AFC88A6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Archery World - Archery Game", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Archery World - Archery Game\n\nArchery World - Archery Game is a simple VR archery game for Meta Quest set on a beautiful island. Test your aim on the archery board, master realistic bow mechanics, and enjoy relaxing yet challenging gameplay. Perfect for casual VR players who want quick and fun sessions.\n\nFeatures:\nArchery board shooting challenges on an island.\nRealistic bow-and-arrow controls.\nProgressive difficulty to improve your skills.\nImmersive VR environments designed for casual play.\nQuick and engaging archery sessions.\nSharpen your aim and experience archery like never before in VR.", "short_d